{
  "game": "valorant",
  "original_path": "D:/Download New/กฎระเบียบและรูปแบบการแข่งขัน VALORANT รายการ PSU Phuket VALORANT 2026 Tournament.docx",
  "sha256": "a824f58e0fb4dcd1db4ea1097fd02e4d6f5d147822d88dc36a69db5518dbf8d7",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "กฎระเบียบและรูปแบบการแข่งขัน VALORANT",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "รายการ PSU Phuket VALORANT 2026 Tournament",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "Update: 17/02/2026",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "English below",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "text": "อุปกรณ์และอุปกรณ์ต่อพ่วง",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "text": "ในการแข่งขันแบบ LAN ผู้เล่นต้องปฏิบัติตามข้อกำหนดเรื่องอุปกรณ์อย่างเคร่งครัดเพื่อความเท่าเทียม",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 7,
      "text": "อุปกรณ์ที่นำมาเองได้ คีย์บอร์ด (มีสาย/ไร้สาย), เมาส์(มีสาย/ไร้สาย), ตัวยึดสายเมาส์ (mouse bungee), แผ่นรองเมาส์ หูฟังแบบ In-ear (มีสาย), Headset (มีสาย)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"6\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 8,
      "text": "อุปกรณ์ที่ผู้จัดจัดเตรียมให้ ผู้จัดจะจัดเตรียม PC, จอภาพ, หูฟังพร้อมไมโครโฟน, โต๊ะ และเก้าอี้ให้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"6\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 9,
      "text": "เทคโนโลยีคีย์บอร์ด อนุญาตให้ใช้ Snap Tap, SOCD หรือเทคโนโลยีที่เทียบเท่าได้ เว้นแต่เจ้าหน้าที่จะสั่งเป็นอย่างอื่น",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"6\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 10,
      "text": "ข้อห้ามสำคัญ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"6\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 11,
      "text": "ห้ามใช้มาโคร (Macros) ทั้งที่ตั้งค่าผ่านซอฟต์แวร์หรือฮาร์ดแวร์",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"6\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 12,
      "text": "ห้ามติดตั้งโปรแกรมเองบนคอมพิวเตอร์ที่จัดไว้ให้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"6\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 13,
      "text": "ห้ามเข้าโซเชียลมีเดียหรือเว็บไซต์สื่อสารใด ๆ บนคอมพิวเตอร์แข่งขันนอกจากโปรแกรมที่ทางผู้จัดจัดเตรียมไว้ให้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"6\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 14,
      "text": "พื้นที่การแข่งขันและกฎระเบียบ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 15,
      "text": "จำนวนบุคลากร ในช่วงเตรียมตัว (Match Prep) มีผู้เล่นได้ไม่เกิน 6 คน",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"18\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 16,
      "text": "อุปกรณ์อิเล็กทรอนิกส์ ห้ามนำโทรศัพท์มือถือ, แท็บเล็ต หรือสมาร์ทวอทช์ เข้าไปในพื้นที่แข่ง จนกว่าจะจบแมตช์",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"18\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 17,
      "text": "เอกสารและโน้ต ผู้เล่นห้ามนำโน้ตหรือเอกสารเข้าไป แต่ หัวหน้าทีม สามารถนำเข้าไปได้ และต้องให้เอกสารแก่กรรมการก่อนการแข่งขันทุกครั้ง",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"18\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 18,
      "text": "อาหารและเครื่องดื่ม อนุญาตเฉพาะน้ำดื่มในภาชนะที่ปิดสนิทและหมากฝรั่งเท่านั้น",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"18\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 19,
      "text": "กระบวนการแข่งขัน",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 20,
      "text": "ขั้นตอนตั้งแต่ก่อนเริ่มเกมจนถึงการเลือกตัวละคร",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 21,
      "text": "เวลาการรายงานตัว ต้องมาถึงสนามแข่งไม่น้อยกว่า 30 นาที ก่อนเวลาแข่ง",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 22,
      "text": "ข้อจำกัดเนื้อหาใหม่",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 23,
      "text": "เอเจนท์ใหม่ จะถูกจำกัดห้ามใช้ประมาณ 2 สัปดาห์ หลังเปิดให้เล่นในโหมด Competitive",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 24,
      "text": "แผนที่ใหม่ จะถูกจำกัดห้ามใช้ประมาณ 4 สัปดาห์ หลังเปิดให้เล่นในโหมด Competitive",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 25,
      "text": "การตั้งค่าเกม (Settings)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 26,
      "text": "ผู้เล่นต้อง ปิด (OFF) การแสดงผลเลือด (Blood) และศพ (Bodies)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 27,
      "text": "ห้ามแสดงกราฟ FPS หรือ Latency ระหว่างการแข่งขัน",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 28,
      "text": "การเลือกแผนที่ (Map Pool): ประกอบด้วย 7 แผนที่ตามที่กำหนด ได้แก่",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 29,
      "text": "Abyss",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 30,
      "text": "Ascent",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 31,
      "text": "Bind",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 32,
      "text": "Corrode",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 33,
      "text": "Haven",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 34,
      "text": "Lotus",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 35,
      "text": "Sunset",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 36,
      "text": "การเลือกฝั่ง",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 37,
      "text": "ใช้วิธีการโยนเหรียญ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 38,
      "text": "การ Ban map",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 39,
      "text": "แบนจนเหลือ 3 แผนที่",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"4\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 40,
      "text": "กระบวนการหลังจบแมตช์",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 41,
      "text": "การบันทึกผล เจ้าหน้าที่จะยืนยัน และบันทึกผลการแข่งทันที",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"1\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 42,
      "text": "การปรับแพ้ (Forfeiture) หากมีการปรับแพ้ ผลการแข่งในแผนที่นั้นจะถูกบันทึกเป็น 13-0",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"1\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 43,
      "text": "การหยุดเกม",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 44,
      "text": "การหยุดเกมแบ่งออกเป็น 3 ประเภทหลัก เพื่อเหตุผลที่แตกต่างกัน",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 45,
      "text": "1. เวลานอกทางยุทธวิธี (Tactical Timeout)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 46,
      "text": "ขอได้ 2 ครั้งต่อแผนที่ ในรอบปกติ (24 รอบแรก) ครั้งละ 60 วินาที",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"15\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 47,
      "text": "เมื่อเข้าสู่ช่วงต่อเวลา (Overtime) จะได้เพิ่มอีกทีมละ 1 ครั้ง โดยที่โควตาจากรอบปกติจะไม่ถูกนำมาทบ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"15\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 48,
      "text": "2. การหยุดเกมทางเทคนิค (Technical Pause)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 49,
      "text": "ใช้เมื่อมีปัญหาอุปกรณ์ขัดข้อง, หลุดจากการเชื่อมต่อ หรือปัญหาซอฟต์แวร์",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"3\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 50,
      "text": "ห้ามผู้เล่นสื่อสารกัน (ทั้งเสียงและข้อความ) เว้นแต่ได้รับอนุญาต",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"3\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 51,
      "text": "3. การหยุดกรณีฉุกเฉิน (Player Emergency Pause)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 52,
      "text": "ขอได้ 1 ครั้งต่อแผนที่",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"16\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 53,
      "text": "รวมเวลาทั้งหมดไม่เกิน 10 นาที ต่อหนึ่งแมตช์ หากเกินเวลาผู้เล่นรายนั้นอาจหมดสิทธิ์แข่งต่อและต้องใช้ตัวสำรองแทน",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"16\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 54,
      "text": "กฎเกี่ยวกับบั๊ก",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 55,
      "text": "บั๊กคือข้อผิดพลาดในเกมที่ทำให้เกิดผลลัพธ์ที่ไม่ตั้งใจ โดยแบ่งประเภทเพื่อกำหนดแนวทางปฏิบัติ ดังนี้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 56,
      "text": "Play Through Bug บั๊กที่ไม่ส่งผลกระทบต่อความยุติธรรมอย่างมีนัยสำคัญ ผู้เล่นต้องเล่นต่อไปและไม่สามารถขอ Challenge ได้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"20\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 57,
      "text": "Major Bug บั๊กที่ส่งผลกระทบต่อการเล่นหรือกลไกเกมอย่างมากและไม่มีทางแก้ไขเฉพาะหน้า ทีมสามารถขอ Challenge เพื่อตรวจสอบได้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"20\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 58,
      "text": "Game Breaking Bug บั๊กที่ทำลายความยุติธรรมของรอบนั้นจนไม่สามารถตัดสินผลแพ้ชนะได้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"20\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 59,
      "text": "การย้อนรอบ (Round Rollback)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"20\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 60,
      "text": "หากเกิดบั๊กก่อนที่จะมีการทำดาเมจใส่กัน เจ้าหน้าที่อาจย้อนรอบให้ได้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"20\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 61,
      "text": "หากมีการทำดาเมจไปแล้ว จะไม่มีการย้อนรอบยกเว้นผ่านกระบวนการ Challenge",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"20\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 62,
      "text": "หากเป็น Game Breaking Bug เจ้าหน้าที่จะสั่งย้อนรอบไปยังจุดเริ่มต้นของรอบนั้นทันที",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"20\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 63,
      "text": "การใช้ช่องโหว่ (Exploit Adjudication)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 64,
      "text": "การใช้บั๊กที่เกิดจากตัวผู้เล่นเองเพื่อสร้างความได้เปรียบที่ไม่ได้ตั้งใจถือเป็นความผิด",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 65,
      "text": "การใช้สกิลเอเจนท์",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"14\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 66,
      "text": "ห้ามวางกล้อง Cypher ในจุดที่มองไม่เห็นหรือทำลายไม่ได้ผ่านการทะลุ Texture ของแผนที่",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"14\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 67,
      "text": "ห้ามใช้สกิลในพื้นที่นอกขอบเขตแผนที่ (Out of boundaries) เพื่อหาข้อมูลหรือสร้างความได้เปรียบ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"14\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 68,
      "text": "ข้อยกเว้นพิเศษ สกิล ZERO/POINT ของ KAY/O สามารถใช้ภายนอกแผนที่หรือจุดที่ทำลายไม่ได้ได้ แต่ตัวมีดห้ามพุ่งทะลุ Texture ที่ควรจะเป็นของแข็ง",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"14\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 69,
      "text": "การกระโดดต่อตัว ห้ามใช้ตัวละครเพื่อนร่วมทีมเพื่อกระโดดไปยังจุดที่สูงเกินกว่าระยะกระโดดปกติ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"14\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 70,
      "text": "บทลงโทษ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 71,
      "text": "เจ้าหน้าที่จะพิจารณาโทษตามเจตนา (Intent) ผลกระทบ (Impact)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 72,
      "text": "ประเภทบทลงโทษในเกม",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 73,
      "text": "การตักเตือน (Warning) สำหรับความผิดครั้งแรกที่มีผลกระทบต่ำ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"2\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 74,
      "text": "การย้อนรอบ (Round Rollback) เมื่อการใช้ช่องโหว่ส่งผลต่อรอบนั้นอย่างชัดเจนแต่ระบุเจตนาไม่ได้",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"2\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 75,
      "text": "การปรับแพ้ในรอบ (Round Loss) เมื่อพบว่าผู้เล่นหรือทีมมีเจตนาใช้ช่องโหว่เพื่อสร้างความได้เปรียบ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"2\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 76,
      "text": "การปรับแพ้ในแผนที่ (Map Forfeit) สำหรับความผิดร้ายแรงหรือความผิดซ้ำที่ส่งผลกระทบต่อผลการแข่งในแผนที่นั้น",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"2\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 77,
      "text": "การปรับแพ้ในแมตช์ (Match Forfeit) กรณีทุจริต (Cheating) หรือล็อกผล (Match fixing)  ",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"2\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 78,
      "text": "ทางผู้จัดการแข่งขันขอสงวนสิทธิ์ในการเปลี่ยนแปลงแก้ไขกฎระเบียบโดยไม่ต้องแจ้งให้ทราบล่วงหน้า",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 79,
      "text": "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 80,
      "text": "English",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 81,
      "text": "Equipment and Peripherals",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 82,
      "text": "In LAN competitions, players must strictly comply with equipment regulations to ensure fair play.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 83,
      "text": "Allowed personal equipment",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 84,
      "text": "Players may bring and use their own keyboard (wired/wireless), mouse (wired/wireless), mouse bungee, mouse pad, In-ear earphones (wired), headset (wired).",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 85,
      "text": "Equipment provided by the organizer",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 86,
      "text": "The organizer will provide PCs, monitors, headsets with microphones, desks, and chairs.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 87,
      "text": "Keyboard technology",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 88,
      "text": "The use of Snap Tap, SOCD, or equivalent technologies is permitted, unless otherwise instructed by officials.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 89,
      "text": "Key Prohibitions",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 90,
      "text": "The use of macros (configured via software or hardware) is strictly prohibited.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 91,
      "text": "Players may not install any software on the provided competition computers.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 92,
      "text": "Access to any social media or communication websites on the competition computers is strictly prohibited, except for the programs provided by the organizers.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"17\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 93,
      "text": "Competition Area and Regulations",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 94,
      "text": "Personnel during Match Preparation",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 95,
      "text": "No more than 6 players are allowed in the match preparation area.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 96,
      "text": "Electronic devices",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 97,
      "text": "Mobile phones, tablets, and smartwatches are strictly prohibited in the competition area until the match has concluded.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 98,
      "text": "Documents and notes",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 99,
      "text": "Players may not bring notes or documents into the competition area.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 100,
      "text": "The team captain is allowed to bring documents, which must be submitted to the referee before the match.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 101,
      "text": "Food and beverages",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 102,
      "text": "Only drinking water in a sealed container and chewing gum are permitted.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"7\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 103,
      "text": "Match Procedure",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 104,
      "text": "Pre-Game Process (Before Game Start to Agent Selection)",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 105,
      "text": "Check-in time",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 106,
      "text": "Teams must arrive at the venue at least 30 minutes before the scheduled match time.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 107,
      "text": "New Content Restrictions",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 108,
      "text": "New agents are restricted for approximately 2 weeks after being released in Competitive mode.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 109,
      "text": "New maps are restricted for approximately 4 weeks after being released in Competitive mode.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 110,
      "text": "Game Settings",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 111,
      "text": "Players must turn OFF blood and body displays.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 112,
      "text": "Displaying FPS or latency graphs during competition is prohibited.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 113,
      "text": "Map Pool",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 114,
      "text": "The map pool consists of the following 7 maps\n- Abyss",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 115,
      "text": "- Ascent",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 116,
      "text": "-  Bind",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 117,
      "text": "-  Corrode",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 118,
      "text": "-  Haven",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 119,
      "text": "-  Lotus",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 120,
      "text": "-  Sunset",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 121,
      "text": "Map Ban",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 122,
      "text": "Ban maps until 3 maps remain",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"21\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 123,
      "text": "Post-Match Procedure",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 124,
      "text": "Result recording",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"10\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 125,
      "text": "Officials will immediately verify and record match results.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"10\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 126,
      "text": "Forfeiture",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"10\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 127,
      "text": "If a forfeit occurs, the result for that map will be recorded as 13-0.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"10\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 128,
      "text": "Match Pauses",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 129,
      "text": "There are three main types of pauses, each for different purposes",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 130,
      "text": "1. Tactical Timeout",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 131,
      "text": "Each team may request up to 2 timeouts per map during regulation (first 24 rounds), each lasting 60 seconds.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"19\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 132,
      "text": "During Overtime, each team receives 1 additional timeout. Timeouts from regulation do not carry over.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"19\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 133,
      "text": "2. Technical Pause",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 134,
      "text": "Used in cases of hardware malfunction, disconnection, or software issues.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"9\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 135,
      "text": "Players may not communicate (voice or text) unless permitted by officials.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"9\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 136,
      "text": "3. Player Emergency Pause",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 137,
      "text": "Each team may request 1 pause per map.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"12\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 138,
      "text": "Total emergency pause time may not exceed 10 minutes per match. If the time limit is exceeded, the affected player may be disqualified from continuing and must be replaced by a substitute",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"12\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 139,
      "text": "Bug Regulations",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 140,
      "text": "A bug is an in-game error that causes unintended outcomes. Bugs are classified as follows",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 141,
      "text": "Play-Through Bug\nBugs that do not significantly affect competitive integrity. Play must continue, and no challenge may be requested.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"13\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 142,
      "text": "Major Bug\nBugs that significantly affect gameplay or core mechanics and cannot be immediately resolved. Teams may request a challenge for review.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"13\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 143,
      "text": "Game-Breaking Bug\nBugs that completely compromise the fairness of a round, making it impossible to determine a legitimate outcome.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"13\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 144,
      "text": "Round Rollback",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"13\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 145,
      "text": "If a bug occurs before any damage is dealt, officials may roll back the round.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"13\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 146,
      "text": "If damage has already been dealt, a rollback will not occur unless approved through the challenge process.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"13\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 147,
      "text": "In the case of a Game-Breaking Bug, officials will immediately roll back to the start of the round.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"13\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 148,
      "text": "Exploit Adjudication",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 149,
      "text": "Intentionally using bugs or unintended mechanics to gain an unfair advantage is considered an offense.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 150,
      "text": "Agent Ability Usage",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"5\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 151,
      "text": "Cypher cameras may not be placed in locations where they are invisible or indestructible due to clipping through map textures.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"5\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 152,
      "text": "Abilities may not be used outside map boundaries to gain information or an advantage.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"5\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 153,
      "text": "Special exception",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"5\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 154,
      "text": "KAY/O’s ZERO/POINT ability may be used outside the map or in indestructible areas; however, the knife must not pass through textures that should be solid.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"2\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"5\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 155,
      "text": "Player Boosting",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"11\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 156,
      "text": "Using teammates to boost to locations higher than normal jump height is prohibited.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"1\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"11\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 157,
      "text": "Penalties",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 158,
      "text": "Officials will assess penalties based on intent and impact.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 159,
      "text": "In-Game Penalty Types",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 160,
      "text": "Warning - For first offenses with low impact.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"8\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 161,
      "text": "Round Rollback - When an exploit clearly affects a round but intent cannot be determined.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"8\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 162,
      "text": "Round Loss - When a player or team is found to have intentionally used an exploit for advantage.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"8\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 163,
      "text": "Map Forfeit - For severe offenses or repeated violations that affect the map result.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"8\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 164,
      "text": "Match Forfeit - In cases of cheating or match fixing.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": "<ns0:numPr xmlns:ns0=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main\"><ns0:ilvl ns0:val=\"0\" /><ns0:numId ns0:val=\"8\" /></ns0:numPr>"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 165,
      "text": "Final Clause",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 166,
      "text": "The tournament organizer reserves the right to modify or amend these rules at any time without prior notice.",
      "style": null,
      "numbering_xml": null
    }
  ],
  "tables": 0,
  "embedded_media": [],
  "note": "Text extraction retains paragraph order and OOXML list metadata; embedded images are not inferred as text."
}